\u003e","ts":"1619419701.181500","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Convert Vim Regex to IEEE POSIX Standard Regex · Issue #14442 · neovim/neovim","id":1,"title":"Convert Vim Regex to IEEE POSIX Standard Regex · Issue #14442 · neovim/neovim","title_link":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/14442","text":"I don\u0026amp;#39;t see any reason why Neovim should keep Vim Regex. It is beneficial to Neovim users for the Regex engine to conform to a standard. Having a separate Regex engine causes unneeded complexit...","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/87d7c11657fd0163a46dee98ca3f10d10f3a2feed9bd72415e6a4d72b1b16190/neovim/neovim/issues/14442","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/14442","original_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/14442"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7UAkc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9787978d-27c0-49c1-90a0-f2d11ae59530","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとはLSPのVSCode前提実装がなくなってくれないと、cocだと使えて他だと使えない問題がきつそう","ts":"1619401520.181200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kmE1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d381d74-2501-4f8c-b983-c830885af4b6","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"nvim-lsp \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; cocになったら乗り換えたいけどあと３年くらいは来ない感じがする。\ncocの作者がいなくなるとかだと失速しそうだけど","ts":"1619401452.180700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"62DZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac475a76-ebcf-4df8-8be0-21c55d3c8085","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"いつのまにか coc.nvim + coc-neosnippetsが安定してしまったので、もうこれでいいやとなってます","ts":"1619401074.179300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W7mM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06181474-b4c4-4ad8-8db6-9602c9db6c81","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私はcoc.nvim + coc-snippetsだからあんまり問題ないですね。vnipより弱いでしょうけど、正直スニペットをペーストしてくれるだけでも事足りるんで","ts":"1619400466.178800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ai/q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"511f89f8-770f-47dd-b87f-66937c76f4d2","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"僕は coc.nvim メインなのですが Neovim の built-in lsp の構成の場合は `nvim-compe + vim-vsnip` ですね。特に vim-vnip は非常に強力で、スニペットの展開の際にLSが返してくる内容によっては coc.nvim だとちょっとゴミが残っちゃうケースも vim-vsnip ならだいじょうぶで安全安心。(もしかしたら軽微な coc.nvim 側のバグなのかもしれまませんが)","ts":"1619400024.177500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sLU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18a416d2-2dd3-4721-80b1-00d4e6af3481","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"そりゃあNeovim標準自動補完だし作者同じだしって感想ですね・・・","ts":"1619399401.177200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mfu"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UJB7T0PT8","text":"\u003c@UJB7T0PT8\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1619364080.176500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
